<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Reckson, Bay Apartment.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Reckson, Bay Apartment.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Reckson Associates Realty Corp to attractive from buy on price, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The source also said Bay Apartment Communities Inc was upgraded to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Reckson ended Tuesday at 36-3/8 and Bay Apartment at 29-3/8.</p>
</text>
